OL,3,AHuman rights lawyer couple sentenced to
OL,4,A10 years' prison in Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Pakistani anti-terrorism court has
OL,7,Fsentenced human rights lawyer Imaan
OL,8,FMazari and her husband Hadi Ali Chattha
OL,9,Fto 10 years in prison, over an alleged
OL,10,Fsecurity breach during a cricket tour
OL,11,Fin 2024.
OL,13,FThe couple were accused of removing
OL,14,Froad barriers and obstructing police
OL,15,Fofficers in Islamabad - charges that
OL,16,Fboth have denied.
OL,18,FMazari and Chattha were previously
OL,19,Fsentenced to up to 17 years in prison
OL,20,Ffor social media posts criticising the
OL,21,Fmilitary.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
