OL,3,AHuman rights lawyer couple sentenced to
OL,4,A10 years' prison in Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPakistan's Supreme Court had suspended
OL,7,Fthose sentences in August, but police
OL,8,Fre-arrested the couple before they
OL,9,Fcould be released. They have been
OL,10,Fimprisoned in Rawalpindi's Adiala Jail
OL,11,Ffor the past several months.
